    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Airlive Bridge 1.4.1</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 10:05:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>19</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[Fixes shortcuts that could stop working after using Auto Cut: its settings no longer take the keyboard, and times are set with arrows on each digit. Clicking away from a text field now finishes the edit, so Space and the camera keys go back to switching.]]></description>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/airlive-project/airlive-bridge/releases/download/v1.4.1/Airlive-Bridge-1.4.1.dmg"
