      <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[The latency buffer is now one setting for the whole Bridge, in the footer of the channel list, and every channel follows it. A lock keeps it from being nudged during a service, and a 60 ms step joins the ladder between unbuffered and the 120 ms default.]]></description>
